---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="page-background">
		<section class="page-layout">
			<!-- Content Sections -->
			<div>
				<!-- My Story -->
				<section class="py-10">
					<div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-5 md:items-center md:gap-12">
						<div class="order-2 md:order-1 md:col-span-3">
							<h2 class="mb-5 font-myeongjo text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">About Casey</h2>
							<div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
								<p>Hi! I'm Casey Takahashi, a portrait photographer based in the San Francisco Bay Area. I love photographing families, couples, engagements, and individuals, and I'm always excited to explore new styles and ideas. I'm especially interested in growing into wedding and product photography as my work evolves.</p>
								<p>Photography has been in my life for over 15 years. I began focusing more on portrait photography in 2016, and a newborn session early on really shifted things for me. It showed me how meaningful these images can be, and how special it is to be invited into someone's story.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<!-- Photo: Right on desktop, first on mobile -->
						<div class="order-1 flex justify-center md:order-2 md:col-span-2">
							<img 
								src="/profile-photo.jpg" 
								alt="Portrait of Casey Takahashi, photographer in the San Francisco Bay Area."
								class="w-full max-w-[250px] rounded-full ring-1 ring-black/10 shadow-lg"
							/>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- The Process -->
				<section class="py-10">
					<h2 class="mb-5 font-myeongjo text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">The Process</h2>
					<div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
						<p>My work is guided by natural light and honest emotion, using simple, clean compositions to keep the focus on people. I aim to create images that feel warm and timeless — capturing fleeting moments that become memories.</p>
						<p>I love working with people and helping them feel comfortable and seen. I'm playful and creative, but also organized and detail-oriented, so the process feels easy from start to finish. From planning to posing to making final edits, I put a lot of care into every step, and I want the experience to feel relaxed and fun — even if you're a little camera-shy.</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Behind the Camera -->
				<section class="py-10">
					<h2 class="mb-5 font-myeongjo text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Behind the Camera</h2>
					<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
						Outside photography, I'm a software engineer by day and a big hobbyist by night. My passions include watercolor painting, singing, running, and cooking. I love spending time hiking in Pacifica, and I have a soft spot for rewatching Friends far more often than necessary.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>

			<hr class="border-t border-slate-200" />

			<!-- Let's Connect CTA -->
			<section class="bg-slate-50/50 py-10">
				<div class="text-center">
					<p class="mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
						I'd love to meet you and help tell your story — reach out and say hello anytime!
					</p>
					<a 
						href="/contact" 
						class="inline-block rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:ring-offset-2"
					>
						Get in Touch
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

